# Scrape outputs and the review pile.
#
# These patterns MUST stay anchored with a leading slash. An unanchored
# `quarantine/` matches a directory of that name at ANY depth, which silently
# excluded `components/quarantine/` from every built wheel — the package
# installed but every CLI command died on ImportError. Anchor new directory
# ignores the same way unless you really mean "at any depth".
/output/
/quarantine/

# Local-only files (kept out of the repo by request).
/plans/
/plan2.md
